  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY20 Mali Partner Cooperative Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali Partner Cooperative Agreement funds the technical partner to provide grant design and implementation support to USADF&apos;s beneficiary groups. Funds disbursed to provide liquidity in light of unanticipated shocks impacting project activities and grantee enterprises due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Funds to assist with project needs in light of fund shortage due to COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
